'''EVA Unit-02''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.7 Update#Update 8.7.5|Version 8.7.5]] quickens attack rate and [[Strengthen|Strengthens]] by 100% at 33% health.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 414
|rarity = UR
|name1 = EVA Unit-02
