|name3 = Unit-02, Code 777
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''EVA Unit-02 & Cat '''at level 10

Evolves into '''Unit-02, Code 777''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
EVA Unit-02 is an excellent Anti-Red unit, thanks to its already high damage which is further amplified by its [[Massive Damage|massive damage ability]], demolishing them in several hits, and its maximum reach can snipe many at once. Although [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red enemies]] are easily countered in melee, EVA Unit-02 offers a comfortable solution to several more ranged threats when used well, most prominently [[Professor A.]] As an [[Long Distance|LD]] unit however it requires some support to prevent the aggressive melee [[:Category:Red Enemies|Reds]] from getting inside its blindspot, especially since its speed can cost its own ranged advantage, and its health isn't that great to begin with.

==='''True Form'''===
Unit-02, Code 777 has vastly improved general performance with faster attacks, making it a great general unit. Likewise, the [[Strengthen]] ability adds to what the unit's already good at and dramatically improves its overall damage, devastating its targets further. While it isn't easy to keep alive on its final knockback as it still lacks any defensive attributes, it's as good as it is. The value of this True Form far exceeds its cost, making it ultimately a worthy addition.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Nuker}}

